  "ingredients": [
    "1 whole chicken, quartered",
    "2 quarts water, or as needed to cover",
    "0.5 large onion, chopped",
    "1 stalk celery with leaves, cut into chunks",
    "0.25 cup chopped fresh basil",
    "0.25 cup chopped fresh parsley",
    "3 cubes chicken bouillon",
    "1 tablespoon chopped garlic",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "2 medium Yukon Gold potatoes",
    "2 kohlrabi bulbs",
    "1 large turnip",
    "2 medium carrots",
    "0.5 medium head cabbage",
    "1 medium tomato",
    "4 ounces fresh green beans",
    "2 ears sweet corn"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7C-TXxm1lTWEe5bRb_f-_v9DsJo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/223032-grandpas-garden-chicken-soup-VAT-step-01-7f746b53ca7c42a8a84e004323440781.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223032/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place chicken pieces into a large stockpot and add enough water to cover completely. Add onion, celery, basil, parsley, bouillon, garlic, salt, and pepper; bring to a simmer over medium-high heat. Reduce the heat and simmer until chicken is no longer pink at the bone and the juices run clear, about 1 hour. An instant-read thermometer inserted near the bone should read 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nwd9Rv4pjN9xHcZXK666LHc89dU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/223032-grandpas-garden-chicken-soup-VAT-step-02-8af7a0b19bd34f69a78d178277072785.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223032/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, peel and dice potatoes, kohlrabi bulbs, and turnip. Peel and slice carrots. Place those vegetables into a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ya0pAQuSiwHsVm3AArFObMaBA-0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/223032-grandpas-garden-chicken-soup-VAT-step-03-7df2050ec9c649cc8b724b134254abf9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223032/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Core and chop cabbage and tomato. Trim green beans and cut into 1-inch pieces. Cut corn kernels from cobs. Place those vegetables into another bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9XFcs5oRAk-OvtBSO0RnDu66_iY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/223032-grandpas-garden-chicken-soup-VAT-step-04-84a5f725905f4543b14b29d176726404.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223032/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When chicken is finished, remove and discard celery chunks. Transfer chicken to a cutting board and let cool for 5 minutes, then remove as much meat as possible from the bones. Chop meat roughly and return to the stockpot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AbqE1RP-ipvGtJD-tR6wBtuZplY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/223032-grandpas-garden-chicken-soup-VAT-step-05-a71da9aa7735408aa3586499fd72b60a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223032/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in the first bowl of vegetables (including potatoes); cook over medium-low until vegetables are tender, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gtTeecXxpNpIm_0yk6CflKRJzGo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/223032-grandpas-garden-chicken-soup-VAT-step-06-032f3d4fdd8f4c3e8bb46a54b0599456.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223032/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in the second bowl of vegetables (including cabbage); cook until green beans are tender, 7 to 10 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/U0lnbBTq51oQTO9-FYSzCom9pZM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/223032-grandpas-garden-chicken-soup-VAT-step-07-81e2e4c4e4a5496aae35f7748f21b039.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223032/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xbzIbWseO9fnF8eH4YOYL23xhdU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/223032-grandpas-garden-chicken-soup-VAT-step-08-29d53b9651c548f8bd02a09b08d815eb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223032/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
